   Thiele ST, 2021, ORE GEOL REV, V136, DOI 10.1016/j.oregeorev.2021.104252.
   van der Meer FD, 2012, INT J APPL EARTH OBS, V14, P112, DOI 10.1016/j.jag.2011.08.002.},
