   LANG HR, 1990, J SEDIMENT PETROL, V60, P504.
   LANG HR, 1987, AAPG BULL, V71, P389.
   LANG HR, 1985, 8544 JET PROP LAB PU.
   SASAKI K, 1983, APPL OPTICS, V22, P599.
   SMITH MO, 1985, J GEOPHYS RES, V90, pC797, DOI 10.1029/JB090iS02p0C797.
